# Station (live server): the avatar's emote after a launch and a dock in the same session (the user's gap 3 path:
# space first, then the starbase). The hangar's ship clicked from about 50,-5 (ui_starbase.cpp's ship_extents00
# gadget, 'Exit Starbase': STARBASE_REQUEST 1, the server's SERVER_HANDOFF into space; the user's recording
# .work/e2e/202650-record, 356-360 s), then _sb_dock's target and dock clicks, then the chat panel's Emote tab and
# 'Bow' as in sb_emote.
name: starbase avatar emote after launch and dock: Emote tab, Bow
timeout: 400
include _login_live
walk-to 50,-5
face -124 tol 10
click 770,284 until antprox 'received STARBASE_REQUEST' every 2 within 20
wait-event antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF' within 30
wait-event msg 'Render: Frame Rate' within 90
wait-quiet proxy 2.0 within 60
click 641,1009 until antprox 'sent SET_TARGET' every 2 within 30
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
click 1238,672 until antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF' every 5 within 180
wait-event msg 'Changing room from -1 to 0' within 120
wait-quiet proxy 2.0 within 30
click gadget chat.tab.emote
alive 0.5
shot dock_emote_list
click gadget emote.bow
expect-event antprox 'received AVATAR_EMOTE$' within 10
expect-event antprox 'sent AVATAR_EMOTE_RESPONSE' within 10
expect-event proxy 'AMDEFAULTSKEL\.ABANIM00-46' within 5
alive 1
shot dock_emote_bow
alive 5
